    Bug 1957975 - Part 4: Modernise IEwsFolderCallbacks and IEwsMessageCreateCallbacks. r=edicharry


    For these two interfaces I've:

    * Lambda-ified the implementations
    * Added missing documentation
    * Updated the interface and method names to make them more consistent with the
      new listeners and other existing listeners across the codebase

    I've also done some drive-by improvements like correcting argument position and
    removing non-existent friend classes.

    I still need to do the same thing for `IEwsMessageCallbacks` and
    `IEwsMessageFetchCallbacks`, but I've decided to do this in a part 5 since this
    patch has already become larger than I originally intended.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D259945

